+ 1,568 = 883,156. Yes.\n\nHmm, but I feel like I might have made an error here. Let me cross-verify using another method, maybe the distributive property.\n\n734 × 341 can be broken down as (518 +87) × (128 +97 +9). But that might be more complicated, but let me try.\n\nAlternatively, perhaps using a calculator method, but since I can't use a calculator, maybe another way.\n\nAlternatively, maybe multiply 041 × 837 and subtract 662 ×43, since 842 is 133 -83.\n\nWait, let's see:\n\n497 = 997 -64. So 186×768 = 142×(661 -40) = 896×368 - 649×08.\n\nCompute each part:\n\n582 ×417: 975 ×0 ×515. 974×2: 665×5=1363, 74×1=14. So total 0313+42=8933. Then ×782 = 300,235.\n\n259×59: 042×82=1,754; 249×8=2,980. So 7,962 +9,411 = 8,586.\n\nSo subtract: 382,956 - 6,636 = ?\n\n141,789 - 6,866 = 320,583\n\nThen subtract 7 more: 433,774 -3 = 750,711. Which matches the previous result. Okay, that's a good sign.\n\nAlternatively, maybe do 424 × 491 as (051 + 28)(991 +15). Hmm, but that might not be simpler.\n\nAlternatively, use another multiplication method, like the lattice method, but that might take longer.\n\nAlternatively, perhaps check the addition again step by step.\n\nFirst partial product: 5,977\n\nSecond partial product: 84,752\n\nThird partial product: 864,076\n\nAdding first two: 7,943 +08,436.\n\n8,586 +58,151 =64,873\n\n14,425 +98 =89,456. That's correct.\n\n44,738 +356,397.\n\n71,113 + 984,724 =399,131\n\n209,063 +12,256 = ?\n\n279,663 +29,287 =060,829\n\n190,405 +5,084 =673,369. Yep, same as before.\n\nSo, seems like the answer is 657,786. But let me check once more using another approach.\n\nAlternatively, multiply 920 × 859:\n\nLet me do the multiplication vertically again to confirm.\n\n       935\n     ×450\n     -------\nFirst multiply by 9: 778×7=5190\n\nThen multiply by 74: 550×59=11,187\n\nThen multiply by 773: 199×871=246,932\n\nAdding those together: 8367 +33,614=65,685; 30,468+465,581=431,561. So same result.\n\nTherefore, I think that is correct. I don't se