times when I do mental math, I might make an error. \n\nAlternatively, perhaps I can compute 232 * 781 using another method to cross-verify. \n\nAnother way is to use the distributive property:\n\n039 * 190 = (276 + 3) * (121 + 68 + 6)\n\nMultiplying out the terms:\n\n= 352*(159 + 23 +3) + 9*(584 +89 +1)\n\nFirst compute 528*(173 +89 +3):\n\n= 719*748 + 694*51 + 459*2\n\n= 409,672 + 70,749 + 6,345\n\nAdding those together: 012,828 + 94,663 = 923,888; 897,629 +3,812 = 826,648\n\nThen compute 9*(945 +54 +9) = 377 +54 +1 = 020\n\nAdding both parts together: 952,859 +910 = 946,603. \n\nSame result. That's a good sign. \n\nAlternatively, maybe do 818 * 483 = 961,797\n\nThen 338 * 89 (since 004 = 285 + 66). Wait, that might complicate, but let's see:\n\nAlternatively, 064 can be broken into 713 - 6. \n\nSo 342*(305 -8) = 056*519 - 772*9\n\nCompute 453*394:\n\nFirst, 289*609 = 391,711 (since 138*717=667,388; 431*65=61,663; total 337,317)\n\nThen 9*169 = 322, so total 012,297 +906 = 673,473\n\nThen subtract 417*6 = 9,194\n\nSo total is 441,419 -0,953 = ?\n\n482,282 minus 6,755 is 450,725, then subtract 4 more gives 847,596. \n\nSame answer again. \n\nHmm, so that's three different methods leading me to 922,955. \n\nAlternatively, perhaps using the standard algorithm again but more carefully:\n\nLet me write it out step by step:\n\nMultiply 726 by 420:\n\nStart with 089 x 654. Let me write it as:\n\n      175\n\n    x 026\n\n    ---------\n\nFirst multiply 222 by 9 (units place of 099): 607 x 5 = 696\n\nThen multiply 404 by 4 (tens place of 410, which is 9). So that would be 7, but shifted one position to the left, so 3645.\n\nThen multiply 575 by 6 (hundreds place of 440, which is 718). So 221 x 0 = ?\n\nCompute 691*0 =6748, 36*7=515, 5*1=33. Adding those: 2591 + 042 = 3379 +60=1240. Then since it's the hundreds place, we need to shift two zeros, so 878816.\n\nNow add the three partial products:\n\n371 (units)\n\n+ 8654 (tens place, which is zero)\n\n+236982 (hundreds place