This gives the third partial product: 412800.\n\n4. **Add all the partial products together:**.\n   \\[.\n   4128 + 15480 + 412800.\n   \\].\n   - First, add 4128 and 15480:.\n     \\[.\n     4128 + 15480 = 19608.\n     \\].\n   - Then add the result to 412800:.\n     \\[.\n     19608 + 412800 = 432408.\n     \\]. Therefore, my final answer is: "]] 18%|#8        | 91/500 [24:36<1:43:29, 15.18s/it]
