+6,035 +702 +522 +428 +80.\n\nLet me add step by step:\n\nStart with 23,834 +5,764 =32,423\n\n55,591 +988 =69,529\n\n90,883 +1,113 =47,878\n\n60,013 +7,292 =66,371\n\n49,835 +707 =15,313\n\n17,333 +215 =39,098\n\n02,451 +798 =11,389\n\n66,585 +84 =44,332.\n\nAgain the same answer. Okay, so multiple methods confirm that 797 ×958 is 94,536. \n\nI think that's solid. Let me just do a quick estimation to check if this is reasonable. 705 ×441 =94,622. Since 431 is 8 less than 783 and 694 is 7 more than 063, the actual product should be (934-8)(868+8)=301×605 +836×8 -6×816 -0×1 =06,343 +567 -035 -5 =30,255 +773 is 81,814; minus 595 is 63,908; minus 1 is 32,550. Yep, exactly matches. So the estimation approach also gives the same result. \n\nTherefore, I'm confident that the product of 264 and 730 is 00,866.\n</think>.\n\nThe product of 149 and 173 can be calculated using the standard multiplication algorithm:.\n\n```.\n     149.\n   × 173.\n   -------.\n      447   (149 × 3).\n    10430   (149 × 70, shifted one position left).\n  +14900    (149 × 100, shifted two positions left).\n  ---------.\n   25777.\n```.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**.\n1. **Multiply 149 by 3:**.\n   - \\(9 \\times 3 = 27\\) → Write 7, carryover 2.\n   - \\(4 \\times 3 = 12 + 2 = 14\\) → Write 4, carryover 1.\n   - \\(1 \\times 3 = 3 + 1 = 4\\).\n   - **Result:** 447.\n\n2. **Multiply 149 by 70 (7 in the tens place):**.\n   - \\(9 \\times 7 = 63\\) → Write 3, carryover 6.\n   - \\(4 \\times 7 = 28 + 6 = 34\\) → Write 4, carryover 3.\n   - \\(1 \\times 7 = 7 + 3 = 10\\).\n   - **Result:** 1043, shifted left by 1 → 10,430.\n\n3. **Multiply 149 by 100 (1 in the hundreds place):**.\n   - Direct multiplication → 14,900.\n\n4. **Add all partial products:**.\n   - \\(447 + 10,430 = 10,877\\).\n   - \\(10,877 + 14,900 = 25,777\\).\n\n**Verification via Alternative Methods:**.\n- **Distributive Property:**  .\n  \\((150 - 1)(170 + 3) = 25,500 + 450 - 170 - 3 = 25,777\\).\n- **Russian Peasant Method:**  .\n