3 + 4 = 67\\)\n   - Add a zero for the tens place: \\(67320\\)\n\n3. **Multiply 748 by 800 (shift two positions to the left):**\n   \\[\n   748 \\times 800 = 598400\n   \\]\n   - Calculation steps:\n     - \\(8 \\times 8 = 64\\)\n     - \\(8 \\times 4 = 32 + 6 = 38\\)\n     - \\(8 \\times 7 = 56 + 3 = 59\\)\n   - Add two zeros for the hundreds place: \\(598400\\)\n\n4. **Add all partial products together:**\n   \\[\n   \\begin{array}{r}\n     \\phantom{0}5236 \\\\\n     67320 \\\\\n   +598400 \\\\\n   \\hline\n     670956 \\\\\n   \\end{array}\n   \\]\n   - Units place: \\(6 + 0 + 0 = 6\\)\n   - Tens place: \\(3 + 2 + 0 = 5\\)\n   - Hundreds place: \\(2 + 3 + 4 = 9\\)\n   - Thousands place: \\(5 + 7 + 8 = 20\\) (write 0, carry over 2)\n   - Ten-thousands place: \\(0 + 6 + 9 + 2 = 17\\) (write 7, carry over 1)\n   - Hundred-thousands place: \\(0 + 0 + 5 + 1 = 6\\)\n\nUsing the distributive property for verification:\n\\[\n748 \\times 897 = 748 \\times (900 - 3) = 748 \\times 900 - 748 \\times 3\n\\]\n\\[\n748 \\times 900 = 673200 \\quad \\text{and} \\quad 748 \\times 3 = 2244\n\\]\n\\[\n673200 - 2244 = 670956\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 748 and 897 is \\(\\boxed{670956}\\).",
