is calculated as follows:.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**.\n\n1. **Break down 121 into 120 + 1:**.\n   - Compute \\( 692 \\times 120 \\):.\n     - \\( 692 \\times 120 = 692 \\times (12 \\times 10) = (692 \\times 12) \\times 10 \\).\n     - \\( 692 \\times 12 = 8,304 \\)  .\n       (Calculate \\( 692 \\times 10 = 6,920 \\); \\( 692 \\times 2 = 1,384 \\); add them: \\( 6,920 + 1,384 = 8,304 \\)).\n     - \\( 8,304 \\times 10 = 83,040 \\).\n   .\n   - Compute \\( 692 \\times 1 = 692 \\).\n\n2. **Add the two results:**.\n   - \\( 83,040 + 692 = 83,732 \\).\n\n**Verification via Alternative Methods:**.\n- **Direct Multiplication:**.\n  \\[.\n  \\begin{array}{r}.\n       \\quad 692 \\\\.\n    \\times 121 \\\\.\n    \\hline.\n       \\quad 692 \\quad (\\text{692 × 1}) \\\\.\n      13,840 \\quad (\\text{692 × 20, shifted left by 1}) \\\\.\n    +69,200 \\quad (\\text{692 × 100, shifted left by 2}) \\\\.\n    \\hline.\n      83,732 \\\\.\n  \\end{array}.\n  \\].\n- **Using \\( 121 = 11^2 \\):**.\n  - \\( 692 \\times 11 = 7,612 \\)  .\n    ( \\( 692 \\times 10 + 692 = 6,920 + 692 = 7,612 \\) ).\n  - \\( 7,612 \\times 11 = 83,732 \\)  .\n    ( \\( 7,612 \\times 10 + 7,612 = 76,120 + 7,612 = 83,732 \\) ).\n\n**Final Answer:**. Therefore, my final answer is: "]] 34%|###3      | 169/500 [37:43<11:33,  2.09s/it]
