ifted one position left):**.\n   ```.\n     867.\n   ×   7.\n   -----.\n    6069.\n   ```.\n   Shifted left: **60,690**.\n\n3. **Multiply 867 by 6 (hundreds place of 672, shifted two positions left):**.\n   ```.\n     867.\n   ×   6.\n   -----.\n    5202.\n   ```.\n   Shifted left: **520,200**.\n\n4. **Add all partial products:**.\n   ```.\n      1734.\n    +60690.\n    +520200.\n   ---------.\n     582,624.\n   ```.\n\n**Final Answer:**. Therefore, my final answer is: "]] 44%|####4     | 220/500 [1:04:50<4:11:33, 53.90s/it]
