times 800 = 329600.\n\\].\n\\[.\n412 \\times 19 = 412 \\times (10 + 9) = 4120 + 3708 = 7828.\n\\].\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]] 96%|#########6| 481/500 [2:06:02<03:46, 11.91s/it]
